OpenMath -- OpenMath support
****************************

Description
===========

This package provides methods  for representing Macaulay2 objects using the
OpenMath (see https://openmath.org/ ) standard and vice versa.

See also
========

  * *note val(XMLnode): val, -- Evaluate an XMLnode containing OpenMath

Author
======

  * Dan Roozemond (see http://magma.maths.usyd.edu.au/~danr )
    <dan.roozemond@gmail.com>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.2.2 of OpenMath, released March 16,
2011.

